# Claude Code. The shared agent setup is committed: .claude/settings.json (hooks), rules/ (lessons that load with the
# code they are about), hooks/, skills/, agents/ and commands/. Everything else there is this machine's own: worktrees,
# settings.local.json, session state.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/README.md
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
